-- c001-v001: Paulos prerit Khristos Yeshu–ka –ke-anusaar aadesh Parameshwar Uddhaar-kartaa hamaare aur Khristos Yeshu –ki aasha hamaari
-- c001-v002: Timotheos–ko sachche bachche –mein vishwaas anugrah dayaa shaanti –se Parameshwar Pita aur Khristos Yeshu –ke Prabhu hamaare
-- c001-v003: Jaise nivedan–kiya tujhe rukna –mein Ephesos jaate-hue –mein Makedoniyaa ki aadesh–de kuchh–ko na bhinna-shikshaa–dena
-- c001-v004: na dhyaan–dena kathaon aur vanshavaliyon ant-heen jo vivaadon utpann–karti-hain adhik balki yojanaa Parameshwar–ki –ko –mein vishwaas
-- c001-v005: –the par lakshya –ke aadesh hai prem –se shuddh hridaya aur zameer achchhe aur vishwaas nikhaalisa
-- c001-v006: jisse kuchh bhatakakar mudh–gaye –mein vyarth-baat
-- c001-v007: chaahte-hue hona vyavasthaa–ke-shikshak nahin samajhte-hue na jo kehte-hain na –ke-baare-mein kinke dridhta–se-kehte-hain
-- c001-v008: Jaante-hain par ki achchhi –the vyavasthaa yadi koi usse vidhi–ke-anusaar istemaal–kare
-- c001-v009: jaante-hue yah ki dharmee–ke-liye vyavasthaa nahin rakhi–gayi adharmee par aur vidrohiyon adharmee aur paapiyon apavitra aur bhrashtaachaar pita-ghaat aur maata-ghaat hatyaaron
-- c001-v010: vyabhichaariyon purush-gaamiyon manushya-apahartaaon jhoothhon jhoothi-shapath-lene-waalon aur yadi kuchh anya –ko svastha shikshaa virodhi-hai
-- c001-v011: –ke-anusaar –ke susmaachaar –ki mahima –ke dhaanya Parameshwar jo saunpa–gaya mujhe
-- c001-v012: Dhanyavaad rakhta-hoon –ko shakti–dene-waale mujhe Khristos Yeshu –ko Prabhu hamaare ki vishwaasyogya mujhe samjha rakh-kar –mein sevaa
-- c001-v013: –ko pehle hote-hue nindak aur satane-waala aur apmaani par dayaa–ki-gayi ki anjaana kiya –mein avishwaas
-- c001-v014: bahut–badh-gaya par –the anugrah –ka Prabhu hamaare –ke-saath vishwaas aur prem –ke –mein Khristos Yeshu
-- c001-v015: vishwaasyogya –the vachan aur saari swiikaarti yogya ki Khristos Yeshu aaya –mein –ke sansaar paapiyon–ko bachaana jinmein pramukh hoon mein
-- c001-v016: par –ke-liye is dayaa–ki-gayi ki –mein mujh pehle dikhaye Yeshu Khristos –ko saari dheeraj –ke-liye udaaharan –ke aane-waale vishwaas–karne-waale –par unke –mein jeevan sanaatan
-- c001-v017: –Ko par Raajaa –ke yugon avinaashi adrisya ek–maatra Parameshwar aadara aur mahima –mein –ke yugon –ke yugon Aameen
-- c001-v018: Yahi –ko aadesh saunpta-hoon tujhe bachche Timotheos –ke-anusaar –ki pahle–ki –par tere bhavishyavaaniyon ki lade –mein unke-dwaara –ko achchhi ladaai
-- c001-v019: rakhte-hue vishwaas aur achchha zameer jisse kuchh–ne tukrakar –ke-baare-mein –ke vishwaas jahaz-toota
-- c001-v020: jinmein hain Humenaios aur Alexandros jinhe saunp–diya –ko Shaitaan ki sikhein na nindaa–karna
-- c002-v001: Protsaahit–karta-hoon to pehle sab–se karna vinatiyan praarthanaaein bidantiyan dhanyavaad –ke-liye sab manushyon
-- c002-v002: –ke-liye raajaon aur sab –ke –mein oonchaai rehne-waalon ki shaant aur sukhi jeevan bitaayein –mein saari bhakti aur gauravapoorna
-- c002-v003: yah achchha aur grahanyogya –ke-saamne –ke Uddhaar-kartaa hamaare Parameshwar
-- c002-v004: jo sab manushyon–ko chaahta-hai bachna aur –mein gyaan satya–ke aana
-- c002-v005: ek kyonki Parameshwar ek bhi madhyastha Parameshwar aur manushyon–ka manushya Khristos Yeshu
-- c002-v006: –the dene-waala apne-aap feerowti –ke-liye sab –the gavaahi samay apne
-- c002-v007: –mein jis rakha–gaya mein ghoshan-kartaa aur prerit sachchaai kehta-hoon nahin jhooth–bolta shikshak jatiyon–ka –mein vishwaas aur satya
-- c002-v008: Chaahta-hoon to praarthana–karein –the purush –mein har jagah uthate-hue pavitra haath –ke-binaa krodh aur vivaad
-- c002-v009: Usi-tarah bhi striyon–ko –mein pahanawa shishta –ke-saath lajjaa aur shaaleenataa shringaar–karein apna nahin –mein guththiyon aur sone ya motiyon ya vastr mehanga
-- c002-v010: balki jo yogya-hai striyon–ke-liye dawa–karne-waali Parameshwar-bhakti –ke-dwaara kaaryon achchhe
-- c002-v011: Stree –mein shaanti seekhe –mein saari adheentaa
-- c002-v012: sikhana par stree–ko nahin anumati–deta na adhikaar–jamana purush–par balki rehna –mein shaanti
-- c002-v013: Aadam kyonki pehle rachaa–gaya phir Havvaa
-- c002-v014: aur Aadam nahin bharmaya–gaya –the par stree bharmaayi–gayi –mein apraadh hui
-- c002-v015: bach–jaayegi par –ke-dwaara –ke bachche-janm yadi rahein –mein vishwaas aur prem aur pavitrataa –ke-saath shaaleenataa
-- c003-v001: Vishwaasyogya –the vachan yadi koi adhyakshtaa chaahta-hai achchhe kaam–ki ichchha–karta-hai
-- c003-v002: chaahiye to –ko adhyaksha nirdosh hona ek stree–ka pati santulit sambhal aadaryogya atithi-priya sikhane–mein-nipun
-- c003-v003: nahin sharab-priya nahin maar-peet balki narm nirvivaad dhana-lobh–se-rahita
-- c003-v004: –ke apne ghar achchhi-tarah prabandhan–karne-waala bachchon rakhne-waala –mein adheentaa –ke-saath saari gauravapoorna
-- c003-v005: yadi par koi –ke apne ghar prabandhan–karna nahin jaanta kaise kaaliisiyaa Parameshwar–ki dekhbhaal–karega
-- c003-v006: nahin naya-vishwaasee ki na ghamandi–ho-kar –mein dand gire –ke Shaitaan
-- c003-v007: chaahiye par bhi gavaahi achchhi hona –se –ke baahar-waalon ki na –mein nindaa gire aur phandaa –ke Shaitaan
-- c003-v008: Sevak usi-tarah gauravapoorna nahin do-baat-waale nahin daakhras bahut dhyaan–dene-waale nahin neecha-laabh–ke
-- c003-v009: rakhne-waale –ko bhed –ke vishwaas –mein shuddh zameer
-- c003-v010: aur ye bhi paraakhe–jaayein pehle phir sevaa–karein nirdosh hote-hue
-- c003-v011: striyon usi-tarah gauravapoorna nahin chugalkhor santulit vishwaasyogya –mein sab
-- c003-v012: sevak hon ek stree–ke pati bachchon achchhi-tarah prabandhan–karne-waale aur –ke apne gharon
-- c003-v013: –the kyonki achchhi-tarah sevaa–karne-waale padavee apne-liye achchhi paate-hain aur bahut saahas –mein vishwaas –ke –mein Khristos Yeshu
-- c003-v014: Ye tujhe likhta-hoon aasha–karte-hue aana –ke-paas tere –mein jaldi
-- c003-v015: yadi par der–karun ki jaane kaise chaahiye –mein ghar Parameshwar–ke chalna jo hai kaaliisiyaa Parameshwar–ki jeevit khambha aur neenv –ki satya
-- c003-v016: aur maan–se badaa hai –the –ke bhakti bhed Jo prakatit–hua –mein shareer dharmik–thahraaya–gaya –mein aatmaa dikha dooton prachaarit–kiya–gaya –mein jatiyon vishwaas–kiya–gaya –mein sansaar utha–liya–gaya –mein mahima
-- c004-v001: –The par Aatmaa spasht–roop-se kehta-hai ki –mein aakhiree samay door–ho-jaayenge kuchh –se vishwaas dhyaan–dete-hue aatmaon bhram–ki aur shikshaaon dushtaatmaon–ki
-- c004-v002: –mein pakhand jhoothe-bolne-waalon daga-lage –ko apne zameer
-- c004-v003: rokne-waale vivaah–karna door–rehna bhojanon jo –ne Parameshwar banaye –ke-liye grahan–karna –ke-saath dhanyavaad –ko vishwaas–waalon aur jaanne-waalon –ko satya
-- c004-v004: ki har srishti Parameshwar–ki achchhi aur kuchh-nahin tyaagya –ke-saath dhanyavaad liye–jaana
-- c004-v005: pavitra–kiya–jaata-hai kyonki –ke-dwaara vachan Parameshwar–ke aur praarthana
-- c004-v006: Ye sujhaate-hue –ko bhaiyon achchha hoga sevak Khristos Yeshu–ka palaa–hua –mein vachanon –ke vishwaas aur –ki achchhi shikshaa jiska anusaran–kiya-hai
-- c004-v007: –ko par ashuddhon aur budhiyon–waali kathaon inkar–kar abhyaas–kar par apna –ke-liye bhakti
-- c004-v008: –the kyonki shaarrik abhyaas –ke-liye thoda hai laabhkaari –the par bhakti –ke-liye sab laabhkaari hai vaaydaa rakhte-hue jeevan –ke ab aur –ke aane-waale
-- c004-v009: vishwaasyogya –the vachan aur saari swiikaarti yogya
-- c004-v010: –mein is kyonki parishram–karte-hain aur sangharsh–karte-hain ki aasha–rakhi-hai –par Parameshwar jeevit jo hai Uddhaar-kartaa sab manushyon–ka visheshakara vishwaas–waalon
-- c004-v011: Aadesh–de ye aur sikhaa
-- c004-v012: koi-nahin teri –ki jawani tuchh-maane balki aadarsh ban –ke vishwaas–waalon –mein vachan –mein aacharan –mein prem –mein vishwaas –mein pavitrataa
-- c004-v013: jab–tak aaun dhyaan–de –ko padhan –ko protsaahan –ko shikshaa
-- c004-v014: na upekshaa–kar –ke –mein tujh vr–daan jo diya–gaya tujhe –ke-dwaara bhavishyavaani –ke-saath rakhan –ke haathon –ke praachin-mandali
-- c004-v015: ye manan–kar –mein in rah ki teri –the unnati spasht ho sab–ko
-- c004-v016: dhyaan–de apne-par aur –ko shikshaa tika-rah inmein yah kyonki karte-hue bhi apne-aap bachayega bhi –ko sunne-waalon tere
-- c005-v001: Boodhe–par na daant balki protsaahit–kar jaise pita jawanon–ko jaise bhaiyon
-- c005-v002: boodhi–striyon jaise maataon jawaan–striyon jaise bahno –mein saari pavitrataa
-- c005-v003: Vidhwaaon aadara–kar –ko sachchi vidhwaaon
-- c005-v004: yadi par kisi vidhwaa bachchein ya pote-potiyan rakhti-hai seekhein pehle –ke apne ghar bhakti–karna aur badlaa lauta–dena –ko poorvajon yah kyonki hai grahanyogya –ke-saamne –ke Parameshwar
-- c005-v005: –the par sachchi vidhwaa aur akeli aasha–rakhi-hai –par –ke Parameshwar aur lagee-rehti-hai –mein vinatiyon aur –mein praarthanaon raat aur din
-- c005-v006: –the par bhog-vilas–karne-waali jeete-jee mari-hai
-- c005-v007: aur ye aadesh–de ki nirdosh hon
-- c005-v008: yadi par koi –ki apnon aur visheshakara ghar-waalon–ki nahin dekhbhaal–karta –ko vishwaas inkar–kiya-hai aur hai avishwaasee–se badtara
-- c005-v009: Vidhwaa naambadha–ki-jaaye nahin kam saal saath hone-waali ek pati–ki stree
-- c005-v010: –mein kaaryon achchhe gavaahi–di-gayi yadi bachche–paale yadi atithi-satkaar–kiya yadi pavitr–logon–ke pairon dhoye yadi sankat–mein-padon–ki madada–ki yadi har kaam achchhe anusaran–kiya
-- c005-v011: jawaan par vidhwaaon–ko mana–kar jab kyonki vaasna–karein –ke Khristos vivaah chaahti-hain
-- c005-v012: rakhte-hue dand ki –ko pehle vishwaas todaa
-- c005-v013: saath-hi par bhi aalasee seekhti-hain ghoomne-waalee –ke gharon nahin keval par aalasee balki bhi bakwaas aur jiyaasuee bolti-hain –ko nahin uchhita
-- c005-v014: chaahta-hoon to jawaan–striyan vivaah–karein bachche-janmein ghar–sabhaalein koi-nahin avsar dein –ko virodhi nindaa –ke-liye
-- c005-v015: pehle-se kyonki kuchh bhatakayi-hain –ke-peechhe –ke Shaitaan
-- c005-v016: yadi koi vishwaasee-stree rakhti-hai vidhwaaein madad–kare unhein aur na bhaar–dale –the kaaliisiyaa ki –ko sachchi vidhwaaon madad–kare
-- c005-v017: –The achchhi-tarah prabandhan–karne-waale praachiinon dugna sammaan yogya–samjhe-jaayein visheshakara –the parishram–karne-waale –mein vachan aur shikshaa
-- c005-v018: kehta-hai kyonki –the shastra bail daante-hue nahin bandh–dega aur Yogya –the mazdoor –ke majdooree apni
-- c005-v019: –ke-khilaaph praachiina aarop na svikaar–kar sivaaye yadi nahin –par do ya teen gavaahon
-- c005-v020: –Ko par paap–karne-waalon sab–ke-saamne sab daant ki bhi –the baaki dar rakhein
-- c005-v021: gavaahi–deta-hoon –ke-saamne –ke Parameshwar aur Khristos Yeshu aur –ke chune-hue dooton ki ye rakhe –ke-binaa poorvaagrah kuchh-nahin karte-hue –ke-anusaar pakshapaat
-- c005-v022: Haath jaldi kisi–par na–rakh na sahbhaagi–ho paapon dusron–ke apne-aap shuddh rakh
-- c005-v023: Aur-nahin paani–pee balki daakhras thodi istemaal–kar –ke-liye –ke pet aur –ki baar-baar teri kamzoriyon
-- c005-v024: Kuchh manushyon–ke –the paap spasht hain jaate-hue –mein nyaay kuchh–ke par bhi peechhe-aate-hain
-- c005-v025: usi-tarah bhi –the kaarya –the achchhe spasht aur –the anyathaa hote-hue chhupe–nahin-reh-sakte nahin sakte
-- c006-v001: Jitne hain –ke-neeche jue daas –ko apne maaliikon saare aadara yogya samjhein ki na –the naam –ka Parameshwar aur –the shikshaa nindaa-ho
-- c006-v002: –the par vishwaasi rakhne-waale maaliikon na tuchh-samjhein ki bhai hain balki aur-adhik sevaa-karein ki vishwaasi hain aur priye –the –ki bhalaai paane-waale Ye sikhaa aur protsaahit–kar
-- c006-v003: yadi koi bhinna-shikshaa–deta-hai aur nahin maanta svasth vachanon–ko –ko –ke Prabhu hamaare Yeshu Khristos aur –ko –ke-anusaar bhakti shikshaa
-- c006-v004: ghamandi-hai kuchh-nahin jaante-hue balki beemar-hai –ke-baare-mein prashna aur shabd-ladaai –se jin utpann–hota-hai irshyaa kalah nindaaein bure shak
-- c006-v005: jhagde bhrasht manushyon–ke –the mann aur vanchiton –ke satya samajhne-waalon laabh hona –ko bhakti Door–rah –se –ke aison
-- c006-v006: hai par laabh badaa –the bhakti –ke-saath santosh
-- c006-v007: kuchh-nahin kyonki laaye –mein –ke sansaar ki na le-jaana kuchh sakte-hain
-- c006-v008: rakhte-hue par khaana aur kapda inmein santusht–rahenge
-- c006-v009: –the par chaahne-waale dhanavaan–hona girate-hain –mein pareeksha aur phanda aur ichchhaaon bahut moorkhon aur haanikaarak jo duboti-hain –ko manushyon –mein vinaash aur nash
-- c006-v010: jadh kyonki sab –ki buraaion hai –the dhan–kaa-prem jiski kuchh–ne laalaayit–ho-kar bhatak–gaye –se –ke vishwaas aur apne-aap chubha-liye dukhhon bahut
-- c006-v011: Tu par aye manushya Parameshwar–ke in bhaag karo par dhaarmikataa bhakti vishwaas prem dheeraj narmtaa
-- c006-v012: lado –ko achchhi ladaai –ki vishwaas pakdo –ko sanaatan jeevan –mein jiske bulaaye–gaye aur sweekar–kiya –ko achchhi stuti –ke-saamne bahut gavaahon
-- c006-v013: aadesh–deta-hoon tujhe –ke-saamne –ke Parameshwar –ke jeevit–karne-waale –ko sab aur Khristos Yeshu –ke gavaahi–dene-waale –par Pontios Pilaatos –ko achchhi stuti
-- c006-v014: rakhna tera –ko aagyaa nishkalank nirdosh –tak –ke prakataay –ka Prabhu hamaare Yeshu Khristos
-- c006-v015: jise samay apne dikhaayega –the dhaanya aur ek–maatra Shaasak –the Raajaa –ke raajaon aur Prabhu –ke prabhuon
-- c006-v016: –the ek–maatra rakhne-waala amarataa prakash rahne-waala apahunchya jise dekha kisi-ne-nahin manushyon–ne na dekh sakta jisko aadara aur shakti sanaatan Aameen
-- c006-v017: –Ko dhanvaan –mein –ke ab yug aadesh–de na ooncha-sochna na aasha–rakhna –par dhan anishchitataa balki –par Parameshwar –ko dene-waale humein sab-kuchh bharpoor –ke-liye aanand
-- c006-v018: bhalai–karna dhanavaan–hona –mein kaaryon achchhe udaar hona saajhedar
-- c006-v019: rakhne-waale apne-liye neenv achchhi –mein –ke bhavisya ki pakdein –ko sachche jeevan
-- c006-v020: Aye Timotheos –ko dharohar bachaa door–hote-hue –se ashuddhon khaalee-baaton aur virodhon –ke jhootha-naami gyaan
-- c006-v021: jisko kuchh–ne dava–karte-hue –ke-baare-mein –ke vishwaas chook–gaye –the Anugrah –ke-saath tumhaare Aameen

